WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.970
You know there's something
else I wanna talk about here,

00:00:01.970 --> 00:00:03.610
just mention briefly.

00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:05.360
Folks, as you're probably all aware,

00:00:05.360 --> 00:00:08.030
we live in security conscious
times here in America.

00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:10.100
And I just wanna take a second and applaud

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:11.800
the security force here at NBC.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:12.890
They do an amazing job.

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:14.220
You probably met some of
them when you were coming in.

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:15.510
Really great.
(audience applauding)

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:17.770
They do a good job.

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:19.413
Crack security team here.

00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:23.100
Crack security team, and I
pass these people everyday.

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.850
I see the security guys,
the men and the women

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:27.730
that are protecting is
here in the building.

00:00:27.730 --> 00:00:29.770
And I see 'em and they're
doing such a good job

00:00:29.770 --> 00:00:31.660
and I started to think the other day,

00:00:31.660 --> 00:00:34.710
wouldn't it be interesting
if I could see what it takes

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:36.833
to be a top flight security guard

00:00:36.833 --> 00:00:39.460
here at 30 Rockefeller Center, you know?

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:42.340
I wanted to know if I had the right stuff,

00:00:42.340 --> 00:00:43.270
if I could do it.

00:00:43.270 --> 00:00:45.040
So folks, guess what I did?

00:00:45.040 --> 00:00:46.630
I joined up for a night.

00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:48.860
That's right, I gave up
my cushy late night job

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:51.270
and I joined in on the security force here

00:00:51.270 --> 00:00:52.620
at Rockefeller Center.

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:56.960
I brought a camera crew with
me and this is what happened.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:58.293
Take a look.

00:00:58.293 --> 00:01:00.712
(upbeat music)

00:01:00.712 --> 00:01:03.712
(audience laughing)

00:01:08.957 --> 00:01:11.680
I'm here at the main
station for NBC security

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:13.120
and I'm here with Oliver Gordon,

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:14.220
one of our top security people.

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:15.053
How are you sir?

00:01:15.053 --> 00:01:16.280
I'm fine tonight, thank you.

00:01:16.280 --> 00:01:18.030
Let me ask you, tonight for one night only

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:20.090
I'm joining the force.

00:01:20.090 --> 00:01:21.140
Is it known as the force?

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:22.140
No, it's known as security.

00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:24.950
Can we say that I'm
part of an elite squad?

00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:25.783
Well, that's a little stretching it.

00:01:25.783 --> 00:01:28.480
The Q ring, the inner ring, the Q ring.

00:01:28.480 --> 00:01:29.313
All that stuff that's good, that's good.

00:01:29.313 --> 00:01:30.470
That's okay?
That's okay.

00:01:30.470 --> 00:01:32.750
One of the greatest thing
about security guards

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:34.790
is they get to carry
around that ring of keys

00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:35.790
that sort of open anything.

00:01:35.790 --> 00:01:36.710
Do you have one of those?

00:01:36.710 --> 00:01:38.100
Oh yeah we got our keys.

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:39.570
What do you got?

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:40.403
Not many, about 10 keys on there.

00:01:40.403 --> 00:01:42.180
Let me see that, hold
that up, jingle that.

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:43.590
I got about 10 on there, that's all.

00:01:43.590 --> 00:01:46.490
Yeah, check this out.
(audience laughing)

00:01:46.490 --> 00:01:48.550
This opens every door in New York City.

00:01:48.550 --> 00:01:50.300
You got the master ring.
And Staten Island.

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:52.198
I also use this at Christmas time.

00:01:52.198 --> 00:01:53.956
(keys jingling)

00:01:53.956 --> 00:01:58.200
(keys clanging)
(audience laughing)

00:01:58.200 --> 00:01:59.750
Men, office down, officer down.

00:02:00.740 --> 00:02:03.963
So how would you say my
first day is going so far?

00:02:04.840 --> 00:02:06.350
A little tricky.

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:07.630
This is where if there's gonna be trouble

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:09.520
it's gonna start here
and it's gonna end here,

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:10.600
is that right?
That's right.

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:12.060
Someone shows their ID

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:13.810
and then it shows up on this monitor.

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:16.390
Do you check the face that shows up here

00:02:16.390 --> 00:02:17.627
with the face of the guy coming through?

00:02:17.627 --> 00:02:18.460
That's right.

00:02:18.460 --> 00:02:20.230
If that face doesn't
match up, what do you do?

00:02:20.230 --> 00:02:21.063
I stop them.

00:02:21.063 --> 00:02:22.770
You stop them, how do you stop them?

00:02:22.770 --> 00:02:23.603
Just tell them to stop.

00:02:23.603 --> 00:02:25.740
No, elbow to the throat,

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:27.530
soft part of the throat right here.

00:02:27.530 --> 00:02:29.100
Drive the tip of the elbow

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:31.110
until you feel the back of the throat.

00:02:31.110 --> 00:02:32.480
That means you've crushed their windpipe.

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:33.387
You got it?

00:02:33.387 --> 00:02:35.830
(audience laughing)
(upbeat music)

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:38.413
(bell ringing)

00:02:44.428 --> 00:02:45.710
Do you hear a noise?

00:02:45.710 --> 00:02:47.121
Yeah.

00:02:47.121 --> 00:02:47.954
Come here.

00:02:47.954 --> 00:02:48.787
Let's check it out.

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:56.119
Hello, how are you?

00:02:56.119 --> 00:02:56.952
Okay!

00:02:56.952 --> 00:02:57.785
Everything all right?

00:02:57.785 --> 00:02:58.618
Yes, sir!

00:03:00.951 --> 00:03:03.951
(audience laughing)

00:03:06.010 --> 00:03:08.040
But she ran away.
Yeah.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:09.230
Doesn't seem suspicious to you?

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:10.200
Have you seen here before?

00:03:10.200 --> 00:03:12.060
She's been here about five years now.

00:03:12.060 --> 00:03:13.640
Not a long time when you think about it.

00:03:13.640 --> 00:03:14.563
Not long at all.

00:03:15.520 --> 00:03:16.890
Sometimes people put in five years

00:03:16.890 --> 00:03:19.836
just to make everybody
comfortable and then chop chop!

00:03:19.836 --> 00:03:21.749
(upbeat music)

00:03:21.749 --> 00:03:24.749
(audience laughing)

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:35.210
This is the nerve center
for NBC security right here.

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:37.573
Can you tell me who is
this guy right here?

00:03:37.573 --> 00:03:39.700
Who's that gentleman?
That's Officer Brown.

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:42.760
Officer Brown, Officer
Brown, do you hear me?

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:44.380
Yes, I hear you.

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:45.720
This is Conan O'Brien speaking to you

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:47.130
from "Late Night with Conan O'Brien"

00:03:47.130 --> 00:03:48.550
starring me, Conan O'Brien.

00:03:48.550 --> 00:03:49.562
How are you?

00:03:49.562 --> 00:03:50.620
I'm feeling good, everything is clear.

00:03:50.620 --> 00:03:52.150
Could you give me a wave right now

00:03:52.150 --> 00:03:53.603
so I can confirm it's you?

00:03:55.123 --> 00:03:56.516
(audience laughing)

00:03:56.516 --> 00:03:58.185
Hi, Conan.

00:03:58.185 --> 00:03:59.610
Do me a favor, just pat
this guy on the head

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:00.770
who's walking through right now.

00:04:00.770 --> 00:04:02.802
Give him a little pat on the head!

00:04:02.802 --> 00:04:04.870
(audience laughing)
(Conan laughing)

00:04:04.870 --> 00:04:07.260
That was nice, that was very good.

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:08.970
All right I'm proceeding to other levels.

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:11.640
If there's any problems at
all, my code word tonight

00:04:11.640 --> 00:04:14.831
is I'm known as the red fox or night fox.

00:04:14.831 --> 00:04:17.070
All right red fox, copy loud and clear.

00:04:17.070 --> 00:04:18.770
I prefer night fox to be honest.

00:04:20.338 --> 00:04:21.387
Okay, Conan.

00:04:21.387 --> 00:04:23.804
♪ Loving you ♪

00:04:25.161 --> 00:04:26.360
(knocking)

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:27.193
Hello!

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:30.793
Hold this.

00:04:35.680 --> 00:04:37.063
That really hurt.

00:04:37.063 --> 00:04:37.896
(audience laughing)

00:04:37.896 --> 00:04:39.700
And I accomplished nothing.

00:04:39.700 --> 00:04:40.871
Can you unlock this women's room?

00:04:40.871 --> 00:04:42.355
Yeah, I have the key.

00:04:42.355 --> 00:04:43.596
I bet you do!

00:04:43.596 --> 00:04:44.799
(audience laughing)

00:04:44.799 --> 00:04:45.632
You dog.

00:04:45.632 --> 00:04:48.990
Look at you laughing, you're
like oh I got the key!

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:50.280
Oh look and it's really worn

00:04:50.280 --> 00:04:51.312
like you've used it a lot.

00:04:51.312 --> 00:04:52.690
(audience laughing)

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:55.270
You see Conan merchandise,
but when's the last time

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:56.970
you saw some "Dateline" merchandise?

00:04:58.355 --> 00:04:59.659
I don't think anything.

00:04:59.659 --> 00:05:01.367
I don't think I can remember any.

00:05:01.367 --> 00:05:03.830
Right, you know what
I'm sayin'? (laughing)

00:05:03.830 --> 00:05:05.410
High five me.

00:05:05.410 --> 00:05:07.386
Okay I've never done that before.

00:05:07.386 --> 00:05:09.374
That was weird, your hand is moist.

00:05:09.374 --> 00:05:11.160
Just gonna look in the bag
just to make sure that that's,

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:12.207
is that okay?

00:05:18.846 --> 00:05:23.846
A fork.
(audience laughing)

00:05:25.810 --> 00:05:27.533
No forks, sir, you know that.

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:31.910
This is the "Dateline" offices right here.

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:33.260
There's Stone Phillips right there.

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:34.093
Have you met Stone?

00:05:34.093 --> 00:05:35.370
Yes I have, I work with him.

00:05:35.370 --> 00:05:36.203
Nice guy, right?

00:05:36.203 --> 00:05:37.760
Yeah he's good, he's a good guy.

00:05:37.760 --> 00:05:39.163
Kind of robotic.

00:05:40.630 --> 00:05:42.560
Have you ever actually
seen him take nourishment?

00:05:42.560 --> 00:05:44.090
No, I've never seen him.
Really?

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:44.923
No.
'Cause there's this theory

00:05:44.923 --> 00:05:49.212
that he's powered by dry cell batteries.

00:05:49.212 --> 00:05:51.332
Not that I know of.

00:05:51.332 --> 00:05:52.180
He might be a robot.

00:05:52.180 --> 00:05:54.810
You've never seen him
drink water or eat food?

00:05:54.810 --> 00:05:56.100
I've seen him drink water, yes.

00:05:56.100 --> 00:05:58.120
Did he put the water near his mouth

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:59.880
and then say, "What's
that over there, Oliver?"

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:01.110
and you looked away and
when you turned back

00:06:01.110 --> 00:06:03.376
the glass was empty but there
was a puddle on the floor?

00:06:03.376 --> 00:06:05.180
No, I have not seen none of that.

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:07.597
Robots do that to distract humans.

00:06:08.483 --> 00:06:09.333
Hey, hey man how you doing?

00:06:09.333 --> 00:06:10.740
Good to see you sir, how are you?

00:06:10.740 --> 00:06:11.802
Good to see you!

00:06:11.802 --> 00:06:12.635
What are you doing?

00:06:12.635 --> 00:06:13.587
Let's go.

00:06:13.587 --> 00:06:15.420
Okay, thank you sir.

00:06:16.495 --> 00:06:19.540
Julie, I'm being frisked
by Conan O'Brien right now.

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:21.620
I'm being frisked by Conan.

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:23.050
Sir, I didn't do anything I promise.

00:06:23.050 --> 00:06:25.590
Do you know this man you're
talking to right now?

00:06:25.590 --> 00:06:26.423
Ryan?

00:06:26.423 --> 00:06:27.530
Do you confirm that?

00:06:27.530 --> 00:06:28.810
Yeah.
You're on your way, Ryan.

00:06:28.810 --> 00:06:29.980
All right thank you sir.

00:06:29.980 --> 00:06:31.152
You have a...
Thank you very much,

00:06:31.152 --> 00:06:32.488
appreciate it.
You have a tight ass.

00:06:32.488 --> 00:06:33.321
(audience cheering)

00:06:33.321 --> 00:06:35.371
I want everyone to return to their homes!

00:06:36.303 --> 00:06:37.469
God bless you all!

00:06:37.469 --> 00:06:39.629
(upbeat music)

00:06:39.629 --> 00:06:42.629
(audience laughing)

00:06:54.897 --> 00:06:57.897
(audience cheering)

00:06:59.090 --> 00:07:01.065
I think I did a lot of good.

00:07:01.065 --> 00:07:02.397
Our thanks to our security gang

00:07:02.397 --> 00:07:03.565
for helping us out with that.

00:07:03.565 --> 00:07:05.546
When we come back, Heath Ledger is here!

